// IEEE 1800-2023 9.4.2: a pending change waiter observes the transient pulse
// even when a repeated whole-root NBA restores the current value. These wide
// updates retain their execution order instead of coalescing in a fixed slot.
// PLAN: talos eval coalesced whole-root NBA: roots=0
// CHECK: {{^}}PASS{{$}}
// IR: @__talos_eval_ordered_nba_queue_v1 = internal
